{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "43788624",
      "title": "More Component Communication: Deleting Tasks",
      "lectureOrder": 50,
      "videoOrder": 46,
      "sourceHash": "93dbc50985332ca2ed67bc06ea24a0b54d9ccb693aa6806286f7800677055b10",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.3,
          "end": 2.43,
          "en": "So now as a next step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.43,
          "end": 5.64,
          "en": "I'd like to make this Complete button here work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.64,
          "end": 8.88,
          "en": "so that when we click it, the task is removed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.88,
          "end": 11.49,
          "en": "That is what completing a task should mean",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.49,
          "end": 13.92,
          "en": "in this demo application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.92,
          "end": 18.92,
          "en": "And therefore we have to go to this task component template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.32,
          "end": 22.63,
          "en": "because it's in there where we have this Complete button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.91,
          "end": 27.1,
          "en": "and we have to add a click listener on it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.96,
          "end": 29.49,
          "en": "so that we can find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.49,
          "end": 31.443,
          "en": "whether this button was clicked or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.46,
          "end": 36.87,
          "en": "And then of course, we want to communicate this information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.87,
          "end": 40.44,
          "en": "that this button in this component was clicked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.44,
          "end": 42.93,
          "en": "to the tasks component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.93,
          "end": 47.01,
          "en": "which is where we're managing all these tasks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.01,
          "end": 51.81,
          "en": "Hence, in the task component, which manages a single task,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.81,
          "end": 54.51,
          "en": "we have to add an output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.51,
          "end": 57.52,
          "en": "so that we can emit our own custom event there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.44,
          "end": 60.24,
          "en": "with help of the output decorator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.24,
          "end": 62.91,
          "en": "that's imported from angular/core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.91,
          "end": 65.7,
          "en": "And then I'll give this property a name of complete.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.7,
          "end": 68.52,
          "en": "And the value, as you learned it before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.52,
          "end": 71.52,
          "en": "is a new event emitter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.52,
          "end": 75.39,
          "en": "which must be imported from @angular/core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.39,
          "end": 79.17,
          "en": "Now we can add a method to this task component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.17,
          "end": 82.68,
          "en": "For example, a method called onCompleteTask",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.68,
          "end": 84.243,
          "en": "or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.08,
          "end": 89.10300000000001,
          "en": "And here we use this complete property to emit a new value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.87,
          "end": 93.96000000000001,
          "en": "And now again, we might want to share some information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 93.96000000000001,
          "end": 96.03,
          "en": "with the parent component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.03,
          "end": 99.963,
          "en": "so we could emit this.task.id here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 101.00999999999999,
          "end": 104.34,
          "en": "Now, just as before with the select event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.34,
          "end": 106.47,
          "en": "on the user component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.47,
          "end": 110.58,
          "en": "you should also add this extra type annotation here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.58,
          "end": 114.273,
          "en": "on EventEmitter when emitting this complete event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 115.35,
          "end": 119.88,
          "en": "Here, I'm about to emit such an id, which is of type string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 119.88,
          "end": 121.77,
          "en": "So therefore we should add string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.77,
          "end": 123.603,
          "en": "between angle brackets here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.65,
          "end": 129,
          "en": "And with that we got our custom complete output here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 129,
          "end": 132.54,
          "en": "Now we can use that in the parent component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 132.54,
          "end": 134.4,
          "en": "of the task component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 134.4,
          "end": 138.12,
          "en": "so in the tasks component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 138.12,
          "end": 142.503,
          "en": "to listen to that event here on the app-task element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 143.73,
          "end": 147.48,
          "en": "Here, we can now listen to this complete event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 147.48,
          "end": 150.543,
          "en": "and then trigger any method of our choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 151.41,
          "end": 154.38,
          "en": "So here I'll simply add such a method then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 154.38,
          "end": 157.29,
          "en": "in the tasks component class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 157.29,
          "end": 159.44299999999998,
          "en": "and I'll name it onCompleteTask.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 161.16,
          "end": 162.51,
          "en": "The name is up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 162.51,
          "end": 165.72,
          "en": "but here I know that I will then get the id of the task",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 165.72,
          "end": 168.13,
          "en": "that was completed as an argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 168.99,
          "end": 171.48,
          "en": "and that it will be of type string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 171.48,
          "end": 173.703,
          "en": "And we can then later add our code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 174.96,
          "end": 177.63,
          "en": "In the tasks component template file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 177.63,
          "end": 181.38,
          "en": "it's therefore onCompleteTask that should be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 181.38,
          "end": 185.94,
          "en": "and we should forward that emitted data as described,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 185.94,
          "end": 189.09,
          "en": "so therefore we pass $event here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 189.09,
          "end": 192.99,
          "en": "this special variable that's made available by Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 192.99,
          "end": 197.373,
          "en": "that gives us access to the event data that was emitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 199.17000000000002,
          "end": 201.63,
          "en": "In the task.component.html file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 201.63,
          "end": 203.94,
          "en": "we can now also complete the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 203.94,
          "end": 207.48,
          "en": "and bind our click listener on the Complete button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 207.48,
          "end": 210.453,
          "en": "to onCompleteTask in this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 211.53,
          "end": 213.84,
          "en": "and in this task component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 213.84,
          "end": 217.74,
          "en": "onCompleteTask then does not want any input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 217.74,
          "end": 220.2,
          "en": "so we can simply call it like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 220.2,
          "end": 222.423,
          "en": "with an empty pair of parentheses here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 223.5,
          "end": 225.39,
          "en": "Now with that, we're emitting the event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 225.39,
          "end": 227.82,
          "en": "We're of course not doing anything with it though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 227.82,
          "end": 230.97,
          "en": "In the tasks component, we got no real code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 230.97,
          "end": 233.463,
          "en": "that would do anything with that id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 234.48,
          "end": 236.31,
          "en": "And that of course should now change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 236.31,
          "end": 240.75,
          "en": "because the goal now is to update this list of tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 240.75,
          "end": 244.323,
          "en": "and to remove the task that was marked as completed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 245.76,
          "end": 250.14,
          "en": "And this can be achieved by setting this.tasks here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 250.14,
          "end": 254.49,
          "en": "equal to this.tasks.filter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 254.49,
          "end": 258.78,
          "en": "so to a filtered version of this tasks array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 258.78,
          "end": 263.52,
          "en": "And this filtered version will be the old tasks array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 263.52,
          "end": 267.6,
          "en": "without that task that has this id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 267.6,
          "end": 269.7,
          "en": "That's the idea here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 269.7,
          "end": 272.34000000000003,
          "en": "So therefore, filter takes this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 272.34000000000003,
          "end": 277.34000000000003,
          "en": "I explained earlier, and we get the individual task here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 277.5,
          "end": 279.33,
          "en": "and we wanna return true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 279.33,
          "end": 281.88,
          "en": "if the id of the task we're looking at",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 281.88,
          "end": 285.483,
          "en": "is not equal to the id we received here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 286.74,
          "end": 288.84000000000003,
          "en": "Because if it is equal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 288.84000000000003,
          "end": 291.33,
          "en": "it is the task that should be removed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 291.33,
          "end": 294.09000000000003,
          "en": "So we wanna return false for that task",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 294.09000000000003,
          "end": 295.443,
          "en": "so that it's dropped.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 296.37,
          "end": 300.24,
          "en": "And therefore, now with this done, if you go back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 300.24,
          "end": 304.86,
          "en": "you should be able to select a user, click Complete,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 304.86,
          "end": 306.52,
          "en": "and the task is gone",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 307.56,
          "end": 311.37,
          "en": "and the other tasks on the other user are still there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 311.37,
          "end": 313.8,
          "en": "Though we can of course also complete those",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 313.8,
          "end": 316.683,
          "en": "until all tasks are completed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 317.82,
          "end": 321.6,
          "en": "And that's therefore another major step towards completing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 321.6,
          "end": 323.793,
          "en": "this first demo application.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
